   "type": "mcq",
   "marks": 2,
   "difficulty": "easy",
   "year": 2021,
   "text": "The relation scheme given below is used to store information about the employees of a company, where is the key and indicates the department to which the employee is assigned. Each employee is assigned to exactly one department. emp(empld, name, gender, salary, deptld) Consider the following query: The above query gives, for each department in the company, the number of female employees whose salary is greater than the average salary of",
   "options": [
    "employees in the department C. female employees in the department",
    "employees in the company D. female employees in the company"
   ],
   "answer": [
