   "text": "Consider the following table named in a relational database. The primary key of this table is rollNum. Student | rollNum | name | gender | marks\n| 1 | Naman | M | 62\n| 2 | Aliya | F | 70\n| 3 | Aliya | F | 80\n| 4 | James | M | 82\n| 5 | Swati | F | 65 The query below is executed on this database. SELECT \\* FROM Student WHERE gender = 'F' AND marks > 65; The number of rows returned by the query is",
